  "releaseNotes": "Loam 3.17.0: Loam.Pickers field-picker validation hooks — DatePicker, TimePicker, and DateRangePicker gain Required (+ RequiredText), a Validation delegate, and a public Validate(), mirroring TextField. Validation runs on every value change (flyout OK, editable commit, Clear, programmatic) and drives Error/ErrorText; it self-gates so manual error state is preserved when unconfigured, and editable parse errors take precedence. Additive, off by default. See https://araxis.github.io/loam/guide/changelog",
